<title>JAPAN: Japan Oct silver imports rise sharply year/year.</title>
<headline>Japan Oct silver imports rise sharply year/year.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's silver imports in October totalled 196.05 tonnes, up more than 278 percent from the same month a year earlier, according to Finance Ministry data released on Thursday.</p>
<p>The figures were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		     Oct 96	Sept 96	  Oct 95</p>
<p> Total	     196.05	159.46	   51.84</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Mexico	     92.13	 54.63	   30.00</p>
<p> U.S.		 83.47	 95.60	     nil</p>
<p>Cumulative imports in the first 10 months of 1996 were 1,101.07 tonnes against 1,077.76 in the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7431</p>
